  "description": "A finite-state-machine (FSM) editor node for vvvv gamma, ported from the cables op Ops.Local.Automata. Author a state machine in an interactive ImGui editor window — states, transitions and regions — rendered as a VL.Skia layer. The machine is stored inside the .vl patch; the running node reports the active state, frame counters and region activity, and fires transitions through a dynamic per-transition bang pin group.",
